From 928fc9ad9d91d6730496f4ccf7a590f142827269 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 07:22:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Fix build-breaking Android Firebase config, iOS
 permissions, input validation, and error handling
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- android: make google-services Gradle plugin apply conditionally on
  google-services.json existing — previously the build hard-failed for
  anyone without Firebase configured, contradicting the app's own
  documented "degrade gracefully without Firebase" design
- android: declare INTERNET, ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE, location, and
  POST_NOTIFICATIONS permissions (POST_NOTIFICATIONS is required on
  Android 13+ for FirebaseMessaging.requestPermission() to do anything)
- ios: add NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription/NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription/
  NSCameraUsageDescription — without these the app is killed by iOS the
  instant it requests location or photo library access
- ios: bump IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET/MinimumOSVersion from 12.0 to 13.0
  to match the actual minimum required by the resolved Firebase/
  google_sign_in/etc. dependency versions
- fix dependency resolution: drop unused codegen dev-dependencies
  (build_runner/freezed/json_serializable/injectable_generator/
  riverpod_generator/hive_generator/riverpod_lint/custom_lint) that
  conflicted with each other under the current Dart SDK and made
  `flutter pub get` fail outright; none of them were actually used
  anywhere in lib/
- add core/utils/validators.dart: centralized email/phone/password
  validation, replacing weak ad-hoc checks (e.g. `v.contains('@')`,
  which accepted strings like "@" or "a@") across every form in the
  app, and add real phone-format validation where there was none
- add core/widgets/app_toast.dart: consistent success/error/warning/info
  toasts (icon + color-coded), replacing bare SnackBars, with
  hideCurrentSnackBar() so messages don't queue up stale
- fix forgot-password sheet silently doing nothing on failure (no error
  ever shown) and not validating the email field at all
- fix contact-us form not clearing name/email controllers after a
  successful submit (only message was cleared)
- add end-time-before-start-time validation to Add Event (previously
  created events with negative duration)
- add "new password must differ from current" check to Change Password
- wire up global error handling in main.dart (FlutterError.onError,
  PlatformDispatcher.onError, runZonedGuarded) and a real AppLogger
  (core/utils/app_logger.dart was previously an empty stub nothing used)
- fix `flutter analyze`: 36 issues -> 0 (duplicate imports, deprecated
  Radio/Switch APIs migrated to RadioGroup/activeThumbColor, missing
  showModalBottomSheet type args, unawaited futures, unused imports,
  missing const)
- add test/ (previously nonexistent): unit tests for Validators and
  AppConstants media-URL resolution, widget tests for PrimaryButton's
  double-submit guard and AppToast

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWLxdJ74EiJDqqczEM3fhE
